  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Pour sugar onto a small plate. Wet the rims of 2 martini glasses with water, then dip rims in sugar to coat. Drizzle 1 tablespoon chocolate syrup onto the inside of each glass.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Put ice in a cocktail shaker. Add vodka, chocolate liqueur, creme de cacao, half-and-half, and remaining chocolate syrup. Cover and shake until outside of shaker has frosted. Strain into prepared glasses. Garnish with additional syrup and maraschino cherries.",
